---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About | Dilanjan DK"
  description="Computational neuroscientist and researcher at Western University. Bridging theoretical physics and clinical neuroimaging."
>
  <header class="py-16 px-4 text-center bg-gradient-to-b from-surface to-background">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">About Me</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted">Computational Neuroscientist — bridging theoretical physics and clinical neuroimaging.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start">
      <div class="flex-1 space-y-4">
        <p class="text-foreground/90">I'm Dilanjan Diyabalanage, a computational neuroscientist and researcher at Western University. My work spans theoretical physics (Loop Quantum Cosmology), clinical neuroimaging (EpiFlow, MT-WAN EEG pain decoding), and open-source pipelines for fMRI and brain data. I focus on scalable, reproducible methods and translating complex techniques into practical tools for the community.</p>
        <p class="text-foreground/90"><strong>Mission:</strong> Bridging the gap between theoretical physics and clinical neuroimaging through reproducible, high-performance pipelines.</p>
        <p class="text-foreground/80">Contact: <a href="mailto:ddiyabal@uwo.ca" class="text-primary hover:underline">ddiyabal@uwo.ca</a> | <a href="https://github.com/DilanjanDK7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">GitHub</a> | <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dilanjandk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">LinkedIn</a> | <a href="https://orcid.org/0009-0004-6672-2636" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">ORCID</a></p>
      </div>
      <img src="/assets/images/avatar.svg" alt="Portrait avatar" class="w-52 h-52 rounded-xl object-cover border border-border shrink-0" width="208" height="208" />
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
